    "problemStatement": "Write a program for the coding challenge \"Floor in a BST\". Refer to LeetCode description: N/A",
    "constraints": [
      "1 <= Number of nodes in the BST <= 10^4",
      "1 <= Node value <= 10^4",
      "1 <= Target value <= 10^4"
    ],
    "inputFormat": "The input will contain a binary search tree and a target value. The binary search tree will be represented as a list of nodes where each node is a list containing the node's value and references to its left and right children. The target value will be an integer.",
    "outputFormat": "The output will be the largest value in the binary search tree that is less than or equal to the target value.",
